  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1102.01 General Siting Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1102.01 General Siting Requirements. The location of a facility shall be compatible with meeting all design, construction, operating, and closure requirements specified for the facility in the solid waste rules, including requirements noted in Env-Sw 1101.02(c), as applicable.\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1100); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2802.01); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14108, eff 11-13-24, EXPIRES: 11-13-34",
